WEBVTT

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.170
<i>I can't sleep.</i>

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.880
<i>H-How did it end up like this?</i>

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:51.600
<i>It was...</i>

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:57.580
<i>That's right, it all started in the principal's office!</i>

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:10.910
Come again?

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:16.580
Mr. Kagami Yuuki, while you are
our newest scholarship recipient,

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:20.280
due to Ms. Kakinozaka Ayana's mistake,

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:23.700
you will be living in the female dormitory.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:26.440
Can't you do something?

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:28.260
I cannot.

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:32.670
The best I could do was provide a double room,
which you'll have all to yourself.

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:34.560
Be thankful for that.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:38.450
I'm so sorry!

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:42.830
I was in charge of assigning rooms to the new students,

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:47.130
and I thought Yuuki would be a girl.

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:51.960
Well, people <i>have</i> made that
mistake before because of my name.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:57.810
Anyway, that's my decision
on this matter, so deal with it.

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:01.560
Oh, by the way,

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:08.050
