you'll be expelled, scholarship or no.

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:09.250
That's how it is.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:13.700
<i>No way...</i>

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:17.670
<i>I worked so hard to get a scholarship
at my dream school, Houren Academy...</i>

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.220
<i>To be expelled after all that...</i>

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:29.330
Principal! In that case, allow me to make amends by living with Yuuki and watching over him.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:33.500
What?! Living together?!

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:37.510
en Academy Girls Dormitory

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:37.510
Um, is this really okay?

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:43.250
Yes, as long as you don't get found out by the other girls living here!

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.890
<i>That's going to be really hard, you know...</i>

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:52.520
And so... It's a little sudden, but since
it's almost dinner time at the cafeteria,

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:55.490
