00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:04.530
They'll never know!

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:07.410
Cross dressing's so embarrassing! I don't wanna!

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:10.210
<i>Cross dressing is a no-go?</i>

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.780
<i>If the girls find out about this,</i>

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:13.840
<i>it'll mean expulsion.</i>

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.900
Ms. Ayana...

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:23.200
In other words, it would be okay were it not embarrassing?

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:27.140
But it's inherently embarrassing.

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:32.240
In that case, I'll just balance it out!

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:33.520
Huh?

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.250
Ms. Ayana!

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:45.410
If you're embarrassed... and I'm embarrassed, it'll even out.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:50.280
