00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:53.410
So Yuuki, now it's your turn!

00:03:55.490 --> 00:03:59.340
You've made your point! I'll cross-dress, okay?

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.240
Yuuki!

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:08.870
Thank you!

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:13.640
