00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:54.730
Yuuki?

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.140
Yuuki?!

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:05.660
<i>Any more of this and I'll lose my mind!</i>

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:09.390
